      "value": "I don't think this is a bug. I see you're a New User and have created your account less than a year ago.\n\nIf your avatar is performance blocked or not available for the platform the viewer is on, they'll see a fallback avatar or an impostor.\n\n[HotDog by PolygonalMinds](https://vrchat.com/home/avatar/avtr_8ee2b82e-1ecc-490e-a67a-ec91aaa12c9d) is one of the public fallback avatars available.\n\nYou can change your fallback avatar, or use an avatar that is well optimized (Medium or better performance ranking) on all platforms. If the avatar is Good or better ranked on \"all supported platforms\" [1], it can also be set as a custom fallback avatar.\n\n[1]: Windows and Android. iOS support is not required.",
